'''Neko Hakase''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained during the [[Cat Busters Collaboration Event]] by clearing Cat Busters' collaboration stage with 28,500 points. It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 309
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Neko Hakase
|name2 = Neko Hakase and Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Neko Hakase and Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This Cat is not good due to its bad stats, range, and Single Target. However, it can attack fast and recharges quickly, on top of the Critical Hits this Cat can be used as a weaker, lower range version of [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]]. Otherwise, it can contribute to your army through [[User Rank]].

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Critter}}

